    "text": "By Jon Sokoloff ,\n1 hours ago\nMETAIRIE, La. - In this week's episode of Black and Gold Weekly, WGNO's Richie Mills and Jon Sokoloff broke down the Saints' recently revealed 53-man roster. They discussed their training camp takeaways and took a look at the current state of the NFC South.\nCatch Black and Gold Weekly on Wednesday nights at 8 on WGNO+ and CTV.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WGNO.",
